2CuniFB02%2CuniFB03%2CuniFB04%22%20%09k%3D%2220%22%20%2F%3E%0D%0A%3Chkern%20g1%3D%22V%22%20%09g2%3D%22b%2Ch%2Ck%2Cl%2Cgermandbls%2Cthorn%22%20%09k%3D%2231%22%20%2F%3E%0D%0A%3Chkern%20g1%3D%22v%22%20%09g2%3D%22comma%2Cperiod%2Cquotesinglbase%2Cquotedblbase%2Cellipsis%22%20%09k%3D%2261%22%20%2F%3E%0D%0A%3Chkern%20g1%3D%22v%22%20%09g2%3D%22a%2Cagrave%2Caacute%2Cacircumflex%2Catilde%2Cadieresis%2Caring%2Cae%22%20%09k%3D%2220%22%20%2F%3E%0D%0A%3Chkern%20g1%3D%22v%22%20%09g2%3D%22c%2Cd%2Ce%2Cg%2Co%2Cq%2Cccedilla%2Cegrave%2Ceacute%2Cecircumflex%2Cedieresis%2Ceth%2Cograve%2Coacute%2Cocircumflex%2Cotilde%2Codieresis%2Coslash%2Coe%22%20%09k%3D%2220%22%20%2F%3E%0D%0A%3Chkern%20g1%3D%22v%22%20%09g2%3D%22s%22%20%09k%3D%2220%22%20%2F%3E%0D%0A%3Chkern%20g1%3D%22v%22%20%09g2%3D%22y%2Cyacute%2Cydieresis%22%20%09k%3D%2210%22%20%2F%3E%0D%0A%3C%2Ffont%3E%0D%0A%3C%2Fdefs%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E%20") format("svg"),
         url("data:font/woff;base64,") format("woff");
